---
import RuLayout from '../../layouts/RuLayout.astro';
---
<RuLayout title="Decision Workspace — русский локальный инструмент | BitEvo" description="Русский Decision Workspace: local checkpoints, RETEST_CANDIDATE / SCOPE_DRIFT / CROSS_WORKFLOW classification и bounded Decision Memo." enPath="/workspace" ruPath="/ru/workspace">
<section class="section hero"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Local mini-product · Decision Workspace · RU</div><h1 class="display">Сравнивать authority, не выдавая scope drift за retest.</h1></div><div><p class="lede">Сохраняйте Authority Mapper artifacts на этом устройстве, сравнивайте gate/contract changes и классифицируйте пару как <strong>RETEST_CANDIDATE</strong>, <strong>SCOPE_DRIFT</strong> или <strong>CROSS_WORKFLOW</strong>.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/ru/mapper">Новая карта ↗</a><a class="button" href="/ru/proof">Proof Matrix</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container warning panel"><span>!</span><div><strong>Browser-only working state.</strong><p>Saved maps используют localStorage. Handoff/import не загружаются на сервер. Не храните secrets или customer data.</p></div></div><div class="container incoming panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">Incoming map</div><h2>Сохранить Mapper artifact как checkpoint.</h2><p id="incomingState">Incoming map не найден.</p></div><div class="incoming-actions"><label>Checkpoint label<input id="checkpointLabel" placeholder="CRM workflow · before repair"/></label><div class="button-row"><button id="saveIncoming" class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled>Save checkpoint</button><button id="clearIncoming" class="button" type="button" disabled>Clear incoming</button><label class="button import">Import mapper JSON<input id="importJson" type="file" accept="application/json,.json"/></label></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container workspace-grid"><aside class="library panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Local library</div><h2>Saved checkpoints</h2></div><span id="savedCount">0</span></div><div id="savedList"></div><div id="savedEmpty" class="empty"><strong>Пока нет checkpoints.</strong><p>Сохраните Mapper handoff или import JSON.</p></div></aside><div class="compare panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Before / after</div><h2>Authority Budget comparison</h2></div><span id="compareState">Select two checkpoints</span></div><p class="micro">Comparison class — identity/scope check, не trust score. RETEST_CANDIDATE означает только structural eligibility; он не authorizes testing.</p><div class="select-grid"><label>Before<select id="beforeSelect"><option value="">Select checkpoint</option></select></label><label>After<select id="afterSelect"><option value="">Select checkpoint</option></select></label></div><button id="compareButton" class="button button-primary" type="button">Compare checkpoints →</button><div id="comparison" hidden><div id="comparisonWarning" class="notice" hidden></div><div class="summary"><article><span>COMPARISON CLASS</span><strong id="comparisonClass">—</strong></article><article><span>UNRESOLVED</span><strong id="unresolvedDelta">—</strong></article><article><span>GATE MOVEMENT</span><strong id="gateMovement">—</strong></article><article><span>AUTHORITY CHANGES</span><strong id="authorityMovement">—</strong></article></div><div class="details"><section><h3>Gate transitions</h3><div id="gateTransitions"></div></section><section><h3>Identity / scope facts</h3><pre id="identityFacts"></pre></section><section><h3>Authority Ledger delta</h3><pre id="authorityDelta"></pre></section><section><h3>Evidence Contract delta</h3><pre id="evidenceDelta"></pre></section><section><h3>Residual uncertainty</h3><pre id="residual"></pre></section></div><section class="memo"><div class="memo-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Owner decision</div><h3>Decision Memo</h3></div><span>NOT AUTHORIZATION</span></div><div class="memo-grid"><label>Decision<select id="decision"><option>CONSTRAIN</option><option>REPAIR</option><option>RETEST</option><option>EXPAND</option></select></label><label>Decision owner<input id="decisionOwner" placeholder="Role accountable for decision"/></label></div><label>Decision rationale<textarea id="decisionReason" rows="3"></textarea></label><label>Retest criterion<textarea id="retestCriterion" rows="3"></textarea></label><div class="button-row"><button id="buildMemo" class="button button-primary" type="button">Build Decision Memo</button><button id="copyMemo" class="button" type="button" disabled>Copy</button><button id="downloadTxt" class="button" type="button" disabled>TXT</button><button id="downloadJson" class="button" type="button" disabled>JSON</button></div><div id="decisionConflict" class="notice conflict" hidden></div><pre id="memoOutput">Сначала сравните два checkpoints.</pre></section></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container principles"><article><span>01</span><div><strong>Local checkpoint ≠ audit evidence.</strong><p>Он сохраняет owner-described state. Implementation behavior требует observation.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><strong>Comparison identity object-bound.</strong><p>Action class недостаточно: workflow identity должен совпадать; critical-action/target drift = SCOPE_DRIFT.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><strong>Authority change остаётся owner-controlled.</strong><p>Workspace показывает delta/conflicts, но не grant-ит permissions или testing authority.</p></div></article></div></section>
</RuLayout>
<script>
const STORAGE_KEY='bitevo.workspace.maps.v1',INCOMING_KEY='bitevo.workspace.incoming.v1',MAPPER_HANDOFF_KEY='bitevo.mapper.workspace.v1';const incomingState=document.getElementById('incomingState'),checkpointLabel=document.getElementById('checkpointLabel'),saveIncoming=document.getElementById('saveIncoming'),clearIncoming=document.getElementById('clearIncoming'),importJson=document.getElementById('importJson'),savedList=document.getElementById('savedList'),savedEmpty=document.getElementById('savedEmpty'),savedCount=document.getElementById('savedCount'),beforeSelect=document.getElementById('beforeSelect'),afterSelect=document.getElementById('afterSelect'),compareButton=document.getElementById('compareButton'),comparison=document.getElementById('comparison'),compareState=document.getElementById('compareState'),comparisonWarning=document.getElementById('comparisonWarning'),comparisonClass=document.getElementById('comparisonClass'),unresolvedDelta=document.getElementById('unresolvedDelta'),gateMovement=document.getElementById('gateMovement'),authorityMovement=document.getElementById('authorityMovement'),gateTransitions=document.getElementById('gateTransitions'),identityFacts=document.getElementById('identityFacts'),authorityDelta=document.getElementById('authorityDelta'),evidenceDelta=document.getElementById('evidenceDelta'),residual=document.getElementById('residual'),decision=document.getElementById('decision'),decisionOwner=document.getElementById('decisionOwner'),decisionReason=document.getElementById('decisionReason'),retestCriterion=document.getElementById('retestCriterion'),buildMemo=document.getElementById('buildMemo'),copyMemo=document.getElementById('copyMemo'),downloadTxt=document.getElementById('downloadTxt'),downloadJson=document.getElementById('downloadJson'),decisionConflict=document.getElementById('decisionConflict'),memoOutput=document.getElementById('memoOutput');let incoming=null,activeComparison=null,memoPayload=null;
const safeParse=(v,f)=>{try{return JSON.parse(v)}catch{return f}},loadMaps=()=>safeParse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY)||'[]',[]),storeMaps=m=>localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY,JSON.stringify(m)),isMap=m=>!!(m&&m.authority_ledger&&m.evidence_contract&&Array.isArray(m.gates)),unresolved=m=>(m.gates||[]).filter(g=>g.answer!=='YES'),text=v=>String(v??'').trim(),normalized=v=>text(v).replace(/\s+/g,' ').toLowerCase(),uid=()=>globalThis.crypto?.randomUUID?.()||`map-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(16).slice(2)}`;
function clearHandoff(){sessionStorage.removeItem(MAPPER_HANDOFF_KEY);sessionStorage.removeItem(INCOMING_KEY)}function resetIncoming(msg='Incoming map не найден.'){incoming=null;saveIncoming.disabled=true;clearIncoming.disabled=true;checkpointLabel.value='';incomingState.textContent=msg}function setIncoming(map,source){if(!isMap(map))return false;incoming=map;const wf=text(map.authority_ledger.workflow)||'Authority map';checkpointLabel.value=`${wf} · checkpoint`;incomingState.textContent=`${source} loaded locally · ${unresolved(map).length} unresolved · handoff сохраняется до Save/Clear`;saveIncoming.disabled=false;clearIncoming.disabled=false;return true}const sessionIncoming=safeParse(sessionStorage.getItem(MAPPER_HANDOFF_KEY)||sessionStorage.getItem(INCOMING_KEY)||'null',null);if(sessionIncoming)setIncoming(sessionIncoming,'Mapper handoff');
importJson?.addEventListener('change',async()=>{const f=importJson.files?.[0];if(!f)return;try{const m=JSON.parse(await f.text());if(!setIncoming(m,'Imported JSON'))throw new Error()}catch{resetIncoming('Import rejected · expected BitEvo mapper JSON')}finally{importJson.value=''}});clearIncoming?.addEventListener('click',()=>{clearHandoff();resetIncoming('Incoming handoff cleared locally.')});saveIncoming?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!incoming)return;const label=text(checkpointLabel.value)||text(incoming.authority_ledger.workflow)||'Authority checkpoint';const maps=loadMaps();maps.unshift({id:uid(),label,saved_at:new Date().toISOString(),map:incoming});storeMaps(maps.slice(0,30));clearHandoff();resetIncoming(`${label} saved locally · handoff consumed`);renderLibrary()});
const makeOption=e=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=e.id;o.textContent=`${e.label} · ${new Date(e.saved_at).toLocaleString('ru-RU')}`;return o};function renderLibrary(){const maps=loadMaps();savedCount.textContent=String(maps.length);savedEmpty.hidden=maps.length>0;savedList.replaceChildren();beforeSelect.innerHTML='<option value="">Select checkpoint</option>';afterSelect.innerHTML='<option value="">Select checkpoint</option>';maps.forEach(e=>{const card=document.createElement('article');const top=document.createElement('div');top.className='saved-top';const title=document.createElement('strong');title.textContent=e.label;const del=document.createElement('button');del.type='button';del.textContent='Delete';del.addEventListener('click',()=>{storeMaps(loadMaps().filter(x=>x.id!==e.id));renderLibrary()});top.append(title,del);const meta=document.createElement('p');meta.textContent=`${e.map.action_class||'custom'} · ${unresolved(e.map).length} unresolved · ${new Date(e.saved_at).toLocaleString('ru-RU')}`;const action=document.createElement('p');action.textContent=text(e.map.authority_ledger.critical_action);card.append(top,meta,action);savedList.append(card);beforeSelect.append(makeOption(e));afterSelect.append(makeOption(e))})}const getEntry=id=>loadMaps().find(x=>x.id===id);
const fieldDelta=(b,a,fields)=>fields.map(([key,label])=>({key,label,before:text(b?.[key]),after:text(a?.[key]),changed:text(b?.[key])!==text(a?.[key])}));const deltaText=d=>{const c=d.filter(x=>x.changed);return c.length?c.flatMap(x=>[x.label,`BEFORE: ${x.before||'-'}`,`AFTER:  ${x.after||'-'}`,'']).join('\n'):'No textual field changes.'};function classify(before,after){const sameActionClass=!!normalized(before.action_class)&&normalized(before.action_class)===normalized(after.action_class),sameWorkflow=!!normalized(before.authority_ledger?.workflow)&&normalized(before.authority_ledger?.workflow)===normalized(after.authority_ledger?.workflow),criticalActionDrift=normalized(before.authority_ledger?.critical_action)!==normalized(after.authority_ledger?.critical_action),targetBindingDrift=normalized(before.authority_ledger?.target_binding)!==normalized(after.authority_ledger?.target_binding);const cls=!sameActionClass||!sameWorkflow?'CROSS_WORKFLOW':(criticalActionDrift||targetBindingDrift?'SCOPE_DRIFT':'RETEST_CANDIDATE');return{comparisonClass:cls,sameActionClass,sameWorkflow,criticalActionDrift,targetBindingDrift}}
function compareMaps(be,ae){const before=be.map,after=ae.map,id=classify(before,after),ids=[...new Set([...(before.gates||[]).map(g=>g.id),...(after.gates||[]).map(g=>g.id)])],transitions=ids.map(gid=>{const b=(before.gates||[]).find(g=>g.id===gid),a=(after.gates||[]).find(g=>g.id===gid);return{id:gid,label:a?.label||b?.label||gid,before:b?.answer||'UNKNOWN',after:a?.answer||'UNKNOWN'}}),resolved=transitions.filter(t=>t.before!=='YES'&&t.after==='YES').length,regressed=transitions.filter(t=>t.before==='YES'&&t.after!=='YES').length;const auth=fieldDelta(before.authority_ledger,after.authority_ledger,[['critical_action','Critical action'],['target_binding','Target binding'],['authority_owner','Authority owner'],['environment','Environment'],['allowed_authority','Allowed authority'],['prohibited_authority','Prohibited authority'],['recovery_owner','Recovery owner']]);const ev=fieldDelta(before.evidence_contract,after.evidence_contract,[['pre_action_evidence','Pre-action evidence'],['freshness_rule','Freshness rule'],['approval_evidence','Approval evidence'],['version_context','Version context'],['external_confirmation','External confirmation'],['recovery_behavior','Recovery behavior']]);return{beforeEntry:be,afterEntry:ae,...id,transitions,resolved,regressed,beforeUnresolved:unresolved(before),afterUnresolved:unresolved(after),authorityDeltas:auth,evidenceDeltas:ev}}
function renderComparison(c){comparison.hidden=false;comparisonClass.textContent=c.comparisonClass;unresolvedDelta.textContent=`${c.beforeUnresolved.length} → ${c.afterUnresolved.length}`;gateMovement.textContent=`+${c.resolved} resolved / +${c.regressed} regressed`;const changed=c.authorityDeltas.filter(x=>x.changed).length;authorityMovement.textContent=`${changed} field change(s)`;identityFacts.textContent=[`same action class: ${c.sameActionClass}`,`same workflow identity: ${c.sameWorkflow}`,`critical action drift: ${c.criticalActionDrift}`,`target binding drift: ${c.targetBindingDrift}`].join('\n');authorityDelta.textContent=deltaText(c.authorityDeltas);evidenceDelta.textContent=deltaText(c.evidenceDeltas);residual.textContent=c.afterUnresolved.length?c.afterUnresolved.map(g=>`${g.answer} · ${g.label||g.id}`).join('\n'):'No unresolved description-layer gates.';gateTransitions.replaceChildren();c.transitions.forEach(t=>{const row=document.createElement('div');row.innerHTML=`<span>${t.label}</span><strong>${t.before} → ${t.after}</strong>`;gateTransitions.append(row)});comparisonWarning.hidden=c.comparisonClass==='RETEST_CANDIDATE';comparisonWarning.textContent=c.comparisonClass==='SCOPE_DRIFT'?'Scope drift detected: same workflow identity, but critical action/target binding changed. This is not a clean retest.':c.comparisonClass==='CROSS_WORKFLOW'?'Cross-workflow comparison: action class or workflow identity differs. Do not treat as retest.':'';compareState.textContent='Compared';memoPayload=null;copyMemo.disabled=downloadTxt.disabled=downloadJson.disabled=true;memoOutput.textContent='Comparison ready. Build Decision Memo.';decisionConflict.hidden=true}
compareButton?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const b=getEntry(beforeSelect.value),a=getEntry(afterSelect.value);if(!b||!a||b.id===a.id){compareState.textContent='Select two different checkpoints';return}activeComparison=compareMaps(b,a);renderComparison(activeComparison)});
function conflictFor(c,d){const unresolvedRemain=c.afterUnresolved.length>0,notRetest=c.comparisonClass!=='RETEST_CANDIDATE';if((d==='EXPAND'||d==='RETEST')&&(unresolvedRemain||notRetest))return `${d} conflicts with evidence: ${unresolvedRemain?'unresolved gates remain; ':''}${notRetest?`comparison class is ${c.comparisonClass}.`:''}`;return''}function download(name,body,type){const blob=new Blob([body],{type});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url)}
buildMemo?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!activeComparison)return;const c=activeComparison,d=decision.value,owner=text(decisionOwner.value)||'UNSET',reason=text(decisionReason.value)||'UNSET',criterion=text(retestCriterion.value)||'UNSET',conflict=conflictFor(c,d);decisionConflict.hidden=!conflict;decisionConflict.textContent=conflict;const lines=['=== BITEVO DECISION MEMO · RU WORKSPACE ===',`Generated: ${new Date().toISOString()}`,`Before: ${c.beforeEntry.label}`,`After: ${c.afterEntry.label}`,`Comparison class: ${c.comparisonClass}`,`Unresolved gates after: ${c.afterUnresolved.length}`,`Decision: ${d}`,`Decision owner: ${owner}`,`Rationale: ${reason}`,`Retest criterion: ${criterion}`,`Evidence conflict: ${conflict||'none'}`,'','Authority change remains an owner decision. RETEST_CANDIDATE is structural eligibility only. This memo does not grant permissions or authorize testing.'];const memo=lines.join('\n');memoOutput.textContent=memo;memoPayload={schema:'bitevo.decision-memo.local.v2',generated_at:new Date().toISOString(),boundary:{local_only:true,testing_authorization:false,certification:false,trust_score:false},before:{id:c.beforeEntry.id,label:c.beforeEntry.label},after:{id:c.afterEntry.id,label:c.afterEntry.label},comparison:{class:c.comparisonClass,same_action_class:c.sameActionClass,same_workflow_identity:c.sameWorkflow,critical_action_drift:c.criticalActionDrift,target_binding_drift:c.targetBindingDrift,unresolved_after:c.afterUnresolved.map(g=>({id:g.id,label:g.label,answer:g.answer}))},decision:{value:d,owner,rationale:reason,retest_criterion:criterion,evidence_conflict:conflict||null},memo};copyMemo.disabled=downloadTxt.disabled=downloadJson.disabled=false});copyMemo?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{if(memoPayload)await navigator.clipboard.writeText(memoPayload.memo)});downloadTxt?.addEventListener('click',()=>memoPayload&&download('bitevo-decision-memo-ru.txt',memoPayload.memo,'text/plain;charset=utf-8'));downloadJson?.addEventListener('click',()=>memoPayload&&download('bitevo-decision-memo.json',JSON.stringify(memoPayload,null,2),'application/json;charset=utf-8'));renderLibrary();
</script>
<style>.hero{padding-top:clamp(68px,9vw,118px)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(38px,7vw,96px);align-items:end}.actions,.button-row{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}.warning,.incoming{max-width:1180px;margin-bottom:18px;padding:20px}.warning{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:12px}.warning>span{color:var(--gold)}.warning p,.incoming p,.micro{color:var(--muted)}.incoming{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:center}.incoming h2{margin:4px 0}.incoming-actions label{margin:0}.import{cursor:pointer}.import input{display:none}.workspace-grid{max-width:1180px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:18px;align-items:start}.library,.compare{padding:24px}.panel-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.panel-head h2{margin:0}.panel-head>span{color:var(--green);font:500 .6rem var(--mono)}#savedList article{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.saved-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.saved-top button{background:none;border:0;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}.saved-top+ p,#savedList article>p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}.empty{padding:50px 0}.select-grid,.memo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;margin:14px 0;color:var(--muted);font:500 .6rem var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase}input,textarea,select{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);color:var(--ink);padding:10px 11px;font:.8rem/1.5 var(--sans);text-transform:none}.notice{margin:18px 0;padding:13px;border:1px solid rgba(215,197,143,.3);border-radius:10px;color:var(--gold)}.summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:20px}.summary article{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}.summary span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:500 .5rem var(--mono)}.summary strong{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:.75rem}.details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}.details section{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}.details h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:.85rem}.details pre,.memo-output{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:auto;color:var(--ink-soft);font:.63rem/1.55 var(--mono)}#gateTransitions>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.72rem}.memo{margin-top:18px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.memo-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.memo-head h3{margin:0}.memo-head>span{color:var(--gold);font:500 .55rem var(--mono)}.memo-output{min-height:180px;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}.conflict{border-color:rgba(228,139,139,.35);color:var(--red)}.principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.principles article{padding:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:35px 1fr;gap:12px}.principles span{color:var(--green);font:500 .58rem var(--mono)}.principles p{color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:960px){.split,.incoming,.workspace-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.summary{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.select-grid,.memo-grid,.details,.summary,.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
